This is an experimental mudlib, using the new features of LPmud game
driver 3.0 . Version 3.0.48 (or later) is required.

It is not the "much talked about" CDlib for Genesis.

I use it more as an experiment to find out "how things really should be
done", and so as not to lose contact with LPC when designing the game
driver.

Mail ideas and suggestions to me (Lars Pensj|) :
lars@cd.chalmers.se
